:''This enemy has no official name in versions outside of [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]]''.
'''Goal Plate Base''' (ゴールプレート城, ''Gōru Purēto-jō'', '''Goal Plate Castle''') is an animated [[Enemy Bases|Enemy Base]] found in the [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Goal Plate Base
|image = E 734.png
|first appearance = [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 0¢ - 0¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy does nothing despite its special treatment as an animated base, basically acting as a regular base that can be hurt by [[Surge Attack]]s and [[Explosion]]s.

